  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760384,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 2 Games in 1: The SpongeBob SquarePants Movie + SpongeBob SquarePants and Friends in Freeze Frame Frenzy - Game Boy Advance\n\nDive into the wacky world of Bikini Bottom with this double-bill of SpongeBob adventures for the Game Boy Advance! This compilation cartridge delivers two distinct Nickelodeon-themed games: *The SpongeBob SquarePants Movie* and *SpongeBob SquarePants and Friends in Freeze Frame Frenzy* (also known as *Nicktoons: Freeze Frame Frenzy*).\n\n*The SpongeBob SquarePants Movie* brings the beloved film to life with engaging gameplay, allowing you to experience SpongeBob's journey to rescue Plankton and save the Krusty Krab. *Freeze Frame Frenzy* is a fast-paced, action-packed party game featuring SpongeBob, Patrick, and other Nicktoons characters battling through various challenges.\n\nChoose your adventure from a convenient menu and enjoy the vibrant graphics and catchy tunes that define these classic Game Boy Advance titles. Developed by WayForward Technologies and Altron Corporation, and published by THQ, this is a must-have for SpongeBob fans and GBA enthusiasts alike!"
    },
